{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Big Balls you roll like a ball. Use your environment and your abilities to gain tons of momentum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends can compete in a variety of minigames, and races, winner takes all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your best times on the Leaderboards, and see if you can hit the global top scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/40210220dbfd1e8f0fa5fe9d8ab58aa7.poster.avif?t=1769127206\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/40210220dbfd1e8f0fa5fe9d8ab58aa7.webm?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/40210220dbfd1e8f0fa5fe9d8ab58aa7.mp4?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity slam: Gain tons of downward speed while midair, - a good source of speed going down slopes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting: Use to turn around sharp corners and  for more maneuverability.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big boost: Charge up a speed boost, when released you gain a burst of speed forward, the longer you charge the more speed you gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/f277794ccb66e00e916bca03a3c6a630.poster.avif?t=1769127206\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/f277794ccb66e00e916bca03a3c6a630.webm?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/f277794ccb66e00e916bca03a3c6a630.mp4?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Customization - change your character look and your ball color!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/6c9471922ffb58285e0178d1f3854b40.poster.avif?t=1769127206\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/6c9471922ffb58285e0178d1f3854b40.webm?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/6c9471922ffb58285e0178d1f3854b40.mp4?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP - Damage players, launch and ragdoll them by hitting them at high speeds, the faster you go the more damage you deal, and the further you launch them. Everything dynamically scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c6f00d850cfadc2ff5dda7cf4bed3031.poster.avif?t=1769127206\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c6f00d850cfadc2ff5dda7cf4bed3031.webm?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c6f00d850cfadc2ff5dda7cf4bed3031.mp4?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Maps (Many more planned)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.poster.avif?t=1769127206\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.webm?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828430/extras/c4b7797d59892e774d631e4cdbae21e5.mp4?t=1769127206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 20 players (2 players minimum is recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdolling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Game-modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Speed Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Movement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public lobbies - anyone can join using the quick play button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies - only your steam friends are allowed to join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Play - Join a random public lobby,  find some new friends to play with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></